# 🐾 Pet Adoption Web Application (MERN Stack)

A production-grade, full-stack **MERN Application (MongoDB, Express.js, React.js, Node.js)** for pet adoption, item/monetary donations, volunteer recruitment, and administrative operations.

---

## 🧩 Tech Stack

* **Frontend:** React 19, React Router v7, Vite, Vanilla CSS3 (Custom Design System)
* **Backend:** Node.js (ES Modules), Express.js v5
* **Database:** MongoDB & Mongoose ODM
* **Security & Middleware:** Helmet, CORS, Express Rate Limit, JSON Web Tokens (JWT), BcryptJS
* **Version Control:** Git & GitHub

---

## 🗂️ Project Structure

```text
pet-adopt/
├── backendfolder/                 # Express.js, Node.js & MongoDB Backend
│   ├── config/
│   │   └── db.js                  # Database connection logic
│   ├── controllers/
│   │   ├── adminController.js     # Admin authentication
│   │   ├── adoptionController.js  # Adoption submissions & queries
│   │   ├── contactController.js   # Inquiry messaging
│   │   ├── donationController.js  # Item & monetary donation logic
│   │   └── volunteerController.js # Volunteer sign up
│   ├── middleware/
│   │   ├── authMiddleware.js      # JWT authentication guard
│   │   ├── errorHandler.js        # Global 404 & error handlers
│   │   └── rateLimiter.js         # Rate limiting for auth & public endpoints
│   ├── models/
│   │   ├── Adoption.js            # Adoption Mongoose model
│   │   ├── Contact.js             # Contact Mongoose model
│   │   ├── Donation.js            # Donation Mongoose model
│   │   └── Volunteer.js           # Volunteer Mongoose model
│   ├── routes/                    # Modular Express routes
│   ├── .env.example               # Backend environment template
│   ├── server.js                  # Backend entry point
│   └── package.json
│
└── frontend/                      # ⚛️ React Single Page Application (Vite)
    ├── public/                    # 48+ original dog, cat, hero, and logo image assets
    ├── src/
    │   ├── components/            # Navbar, Footer, AdoptModal, DonateModal, ContactSection
    │   ├── pages/                 # HomePage, DonatePage, VolunteerPage, MoreDogs, MoreCats, Admin
    │   ├── api.js                 # Dynamic API URL resolver
    │   ├── index.css              # Consolidated stylesheet preserving 100% original design
    │   ├── App.jsx                # Router definition
    │   └── main.jsx               # React DOM Root
    ├── index.html                 # Single HTML Entrypoint
    └── package.json
```

---

## 🚀 How to Run Locally

### 1️⃣ Clone the Repository
```bash
git clone https://github.com/KalikiriHema/pet-adoption-project.git
cd pet-adoption-project
```

### 2️⃣ Run the Backend
```bash
cd backendfolder
npm install
npm run dev
```
*Backend runs on: `http://localhost:5000`*

### 3️⃣ Run the React Frontend
Open a second terminal window:
```bash
cd frontend
npm install
npm run dev
```
*Frontend runs on: `http://localhost:3000`*

---

## 🧪 API Endpoints

| Method | Endpoint | Access | Description |
| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |
| `POST` | `/api/admin/login` | Public | Authenticate admin & receive JWT |
| `GET` | `/api/adoptions` | Admin | Fetch all adoption requests |
| `POST` | `/api/adoptions` | Public | Submit a new pet adoption inquiry |
| `GET` | `/api/donations` | Admin | Fetch all monetary & item donations |
| `POST` | `/api/donations/money` | Public | Record a monetary donation |
| `POST` | `/api/donations/item` | Public | Record an item/supply donation |
| `GET` | `/api/volunteers` | Admin | Retrieve volunteer submissions |
| `POST` | `/api/volunteers` | Public | Register as a volunteer |
| `GET` | `/api/contacts` | Admin | Retrieve contact messages |
| `POST` | `/api/contacts` | Public | Submit a contact message |
